    "id": "258c6e9b-5e33-4986-a34a-ff9db4e65adf",
    "body": "For Gap = 13, n = 6 so comparison never executes, 0 compares. \nGap = 4 gives 2 compares (P < U, U < E). \nGap = 1 gives 7 compares (U < U, U < R, R < D, D < P, R < D, D < E, P < E). Total is 9 compares.",
